WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:06.910
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.790
Yume no naka de

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:17.750
Sagashita amai negai, kyou mo

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:26.120
Kizuite to, watashi no naka kara

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.000
Dare ka ga kimi e to sakebu yo

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:37.830
Mitsumeau, modokashii kyori ni

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.080
Abaredashita samishisa

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.040
Kamishimeru hitori

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.950
Suki toiu omoi o

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:54.080
Iitai demo ienai

00:00:54.080 --> 00:01:00.830
Itsumo soba ni kimi ga iru no ni

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.160
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.200
Yume no naka de

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.040
Tomoshita tsuyoi omoi

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:19.450
Mayowanai mayoitaku wa nai kara

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:24.410
Shinjite ima, ippo fumidasou

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.870
For the sake of myself

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.200
Big Sister Shino...

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:55.500
Their many walls of defense are easily penetrated...

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.500
This is exactly what is expected
of Odin's number one spear.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.750
And yet...

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.830
Her power is...

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.950
You are an eyesore, Einheijer!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.080
What are you doing?

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.330
Are you not going to protect Einheijer?

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.160
Why must I do something like that?

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.000
I am the spear.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.330
I am only meant to gouge the life from you.

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.870
So it turned out to be instant love, eh?

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.120
Roskva.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:35.790
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:45.580
In that case, don't hesitate to come crush Us!

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:51.200
If I don't keep coming back unashamedly
when I've yet to destroy you,

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.200
I couldn't bear to face that weakling
who's finally shown he's a man in some way.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.700
You should have noticed this.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.410
As for my beloved sisters,

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.580
they are connected and understood
through the red string of fate.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.700
The restraints have been lifted...

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.160
it's time for the counterattack!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.290
Takuma!

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.160
Danger
Drop

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.000
Natsuki-san!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.250
Takuma!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.250
Kiss with Lover, confirmed.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:38.200
Kiss with Lover

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:39.540
Confirmed

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.580
Sacred Blade third form constraints, released.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.080
Siegrune invoked.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.950
Siegrune
Blade

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.250
All of you, return!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.750
You will guard Roskva and Us with your souls!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.790
Do you think I'll let you go?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.750
No, no, no!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.160
At this rate...

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.500
Our Lady...

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.910
Please, tell me your decision.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.370
No! That is one thing we must not do!

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.410
Our Lady!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.910
Understood.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.160
The akuma disappeared.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.330
O, Rune. Please grant us your power.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.870
Unleash the maximum Sacred Blade!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.080
Takuma, get behind us!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.750
I wanted this settled before it got to this point...

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.250
What's going on?

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.000
It's coming...

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.790
the galdr!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:02.370
O, Rune; Please lay waste to our enemies.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:06.620
O, Rune; Please grant us this victory.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.290
There is no need to take note.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.040
Etch this into your minds.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:25.950
All living creatures who gaze upon this form
will be slaughtered, down to its very soul.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.500
Roskva, how are you doing?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.080
There are no problems here, Our Lady.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.580
Please use as much power as you see fit.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.370
Takuma! Under no circumstances
must you leave this space!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.250
Okay.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.410
This is a very firm wall... But,

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.160
not too much for the Captain's spear!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.040
Great!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:03.620
Huh?

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.620
Valkyrie...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.330
Einheijer...

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.910
castle wall...

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:09.540
barrier.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.290
You're all such a nuisance.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.200
Hagar.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.700
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.040
Master...

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.290
Am I alive?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.700
Takuma...

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.540
Listen, Takuma-chan.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.250
The Norn is eager for this battle.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:06.330
She'll set up a surprise attack,
then immediately come and assail us,

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.870
and I can't be sure why,

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.660
but if we can just get through it
a chance for victory will surely arise!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.450
That's much easier said than done...

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.500
What's going on? Are they hurt?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.040
Was Shino's barrier broken?!

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.040
All of you, get away!

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.250
Huh? What happened?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.410
A soul-devouring akuma?!

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:40.290
This is bad!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.750
Hagar.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.080
Our Lady...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.290
Takuma!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:13.870
I will protect everyone with my soul!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.750
Takuma-chan...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.700
Our Lady...

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.290
You truly are too kind.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:50.250
But it's precisely due to that I am here.

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.370
Please,

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:56.700
I beg you, stay well, Our Lady.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.660
The Norn's transformation... broke?!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:22.450
We thought they were being hasty in battle,
but Snorri was the reason for that, huh?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.330
Don't hurt Roskva!

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:36.040
My father's orders were to avoid killing
as best as I could.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:39.790
However, it's already past that point.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.910
You... your eye!

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.370
Shino...

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.080
Takuma! Stay with me!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.580
He pushed his ability too far.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.540
His soul is worn down.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.830
He continued using his ability
until he was coughing up blood.

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:15.870
Hey! Is everyone safe?!

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.040
Hurry!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.790
We're too noticeable here, so we'll carry him home.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.080
O-okay.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.080
Oh no!

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.870
How did you fair, Our Lady?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:33.450
I am sorry. I missed my shot at Einheijer.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:37.830
Once Roskva showed signs of illness,
so we're retreating at once.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.080
However, the minimum duty has been fulfilled.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.620
There are no complaints, are there?!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.620
Of course not, Our Lady.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.410
Thanks to you drawing the attention of the Valkyrie,

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:51.120
and destroying the barrier
and the castle surrounding them

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.500
we have gained control of the situation.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:01.330
This is an unbelievable number
for the run-of-the-mill dwarf.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:05.200
There are as many as hundreds of millions
of aether crystallizations.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.750
This is undoubtedly the work of misteltein.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.580
Hey, I can't break this cocoon.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.870
The thread, huh?

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.370
Our target has been captured.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.790
We are getting out of here right away, Garm.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.040
When the spear and the castle get here
it will be a nuisance.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.700
You're ordering me to "stay" again?!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.870
You... Give back the misteltein!

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:44.370
Well. I guess it's okay if I have one of these, right?

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.370
That was delicious!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.370
Big Sister Misa!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.660
Are you awake, Futaba?

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.620
Is everyone... Is everyone okay?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.120
Misa took the Fang head on.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.410
That would normally result in instant death, but...

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.700
of course that's not the case for my little sister.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:21.540
The threads that she had set up throughout her body
instantly stitched her wounds back up.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.500
Right now, Lover is working on healing her.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.500
Her body is back to normal.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.250
But the problem is...

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.080
Sister! Wake up, Big Sister Misa!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.790
She's stopped bleeding, so why...

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:34.870
Big Sister Misa!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:41.950
When I healed Natsuki-san and Ichika-san, there was
a sense that I was touching both body and soul.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:46.870
But...right now, I can only feel Misa-san's body.

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:51.790
There's no soul left inside of Misa-san.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.830
It can't be true...

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:02.620
Did I actually... die?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.870
I'm freezing.

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:07.700
This is the darkness of
the furthest reaches of the aether.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.950
Is this what they call Niflheim?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.700
My soul is being dragged in.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.620
Is this where my battle ends, then?

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.790
My little sisters are probably crying.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.950
But my big sisters may be
the ones crying the most...

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.410
They're both fairly sensitive.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.000
I guess I won't see the others again...

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.290
Big Sister Misa!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:40.910
Someone...

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:42.580
help me!

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.080
Takuma!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.000
You transformed!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.910
Wait... Did you die too?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.290
I'll explain later!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.290
He's really saving Misa's soul?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:07.200
If it doesn't go well, he loses his too.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.200
It's okay. I'm sure he can do it.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.830
Do you know the way out of here?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.660
I've got this!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.080
Wait... wait...

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.750
This is strange.

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:28.000
Mom died, and I was afraid of everything,

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:31.830
so I've spent the past few years
only staring at them in my hands.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.830
Complete Preparations in 30 days
Common Questions on the Exam

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.080
And now in these few months,

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:37.500
it's become a light that illuminates the darkness.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:46.080
He was exhausted after combat
with the Norn, wasn't he?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.120
Leave me behind.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.410
You'll get trapped here too at this rate.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.790
I can't kill Einheijer.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.450
Yeah... Ichika-san said that too.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:09.250
I can't fight directly.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.620
The least I can do is make every effort
to support you all in the background.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:16.000
And that's exactly why I will become a strong man.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:19.120
I never want you to see me looking so pathetic again.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:22.540
I've said goodbye from my old self.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.620
A man that can be relied on
and put everyone at ease...

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:32.450
I will become a man worthy of you all!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.120
Takuma's body...

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.580
it's so warm.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.700
Is this love?

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.370
It's not an emotion I understand well, but...

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:49.700
this warmth might be it.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:59.370
Takuma.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:04.540
Takuma.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.250
Natsuki-san?

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:22.660
B...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.830
Big Sis Misa!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.200
Guys... This hurts. I'm gonna die.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.500
I'm sorry, Big Sister Misa.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:34.950
Sob
Sob

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.660
Sorry!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.950
Thank goodness, thank goodness!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:40.450
Bounce
Bounce

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.540
Thank goodness, thank goodness!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.540
Oh dear.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.250
Misa!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.410
Sorry, Big Sister Ichika, Big Sister Futaba...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.250
I couldn't protect the misteltein.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.700
You did what you could!

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.660
More importantly,
thank you for protecting everyone.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:53.950
She's right, Misa!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.540
Thanks, everyone.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.410
Thanks, Takuma.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.540
Er, uh...

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:14.370
Well, what do you think, Big Sister Ichika?

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.750
Are you referring to Lover?

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:21.910
Yes. He opened the door to Niflheim
and brought back a soul...

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:25.000
I think he's already beyond just healing territory.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.410
It was a mystery as to why Father had
chosen that guy as Einheijer, but...

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:33.370
The summer day that Takuma-chan
saved Natsuki-chan...

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.200
You were really great, Takuma!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.370
I knew you could do it!

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:38.120
no, the day Takuma-chan's mother
died eight years ago,

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.120
U-uh, really? I didn't know if I could.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.250
You were worried, right?

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.790
Yeah, but I'm glad it went well.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.250
his fate was probably already decided.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.540
his fate was probably already decided.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.120
So, do you want something to eat?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.580
Right, Shino-chan?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.160
Big Sister Shino!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.200
Big Sister... Shino?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.950
It's a pleasure to meet you, Master.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:58.290
I'm the fourth of the nine Valkyrie sisters,
Shino Waltraute.

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:01.830
I hope we will get along from today forward.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.910
Why are you here?

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.330
Is it okay for you to leave the storehouse?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.290
I'm sorry, my dear sister.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:14.750
I'm concerned for your well-being,
but we need your strength now, Shino.

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.370
We need the power of "Waltraute,"
the strongest Valkyrie.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.370
Shino-san...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.790
Where was she...

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:34.040
I'm sorry!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:35.290
Yamada!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:39.410
Akuma...

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.410
Are you okay, Takuma?

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.120
I-I'll be fine.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.950
Recently, the symptoms of my
fear of people have hardly shown up,

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:48.950
so I was able to solve
all of the problems in every subject.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.500
Academic
Achievement

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.500
It's thanks to all of them.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:54.830
I want to escape from being the lowest
ranking student and getting the booby prize...

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.410
No, I pray I can get into the top 300 in our grade!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.540
Takuma-kun! Natsuki-chan!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.290
Come look at this!

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.500
It's Akuma!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.160
We're gonna die! Run!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.870
That was my promise.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.540
The dearly held promise I made to my mother,

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.200
Ta-

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.200
1 Takuma Akutsu
2 Itsuyo Saotome

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.950
etched into my memories.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.200
1 Takuma Akutsu

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.950
Hug

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.950
You did it!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.700
This is amazing, Takuma!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.080
And just as your symptoms have gone away!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.330
Er...

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.450
Student Council President

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.870
Well done, Takuma-san!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:35.450
As student council president, please allow me to
bestow upon you the highest of compliments!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.450
Gleam

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:37.000
Oh my, President!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.120
You have done...

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.450
JUST LOVELY!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:42.200
It's so amazing that you're
the top student, Takuma-kun.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.870
No... There must be some mistake.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.830
No, there wasn't.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.000
We've been watching you the entire time.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.750
We know how hard you worked to get there.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.000
You were at your desk every night, without fail.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.000
Yeah, it's true.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.620
It is indeed!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:03.080
You've finally fulfilled your promise
to your mother, huh?

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:07.540
Sorry, Mom.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.250
I didn't do very well on the test today.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:14.870
B-but, I'll ace the next one for sure, okay?

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.410
I'm looking forward to it, Takuma.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.410
Akutsu Family Tomb

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:29.790
Sorry it took so long, Mom.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.660
Let's get Big Sister Futaba to make us a feast.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.700
Yeah!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.620
To celebrate Big Sister Misa's recovery, too!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:43.870
E-excuse me!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.660
Takuma... You are unbelievable!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.790
I love all of you!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.000
Huh?

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.200
Takuma-kun...

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.870
This is very sudden...

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.370
I-I'm sorry!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:04.750
But... just once, I wanted to tell you
how I feel using the proper words!

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:08.080
I need to say I love you all, as women!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:11.830
Even if you do, you're really going to say that
out of the blue in a situation like this?!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:12.660
Moron!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.700
I'm sorry!

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.290
Disgraceful...

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:18.660
Takuma-kun...

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:21.660
He loves us?

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.330
I-I already knew that.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:28.540
I knew that you love not only me,
but all of my sisters.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:32.410
I'm not so foolish as to take him seriously.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:35.080
If anything, the competition starts here...

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.620
As for me, I love everyone.

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:41.160
And Itsuyo, and Mutsumi...

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.370
However, someday...

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
I hope he chooses only me.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:57.450
The myths speak of goddesses known as Valkyrie,
in the Valhalla of Asgard.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.330
These goddesses become stronger
as long as they are in love.

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:05.250
And that is because...

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:08.370
Love is the source of a maiden's power!

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:14.450
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:17.700
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:24.250
Koi o shiranakucha you and I, hajimaranai no yo?

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:36.750
Nine times out of love on cloud nine

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.750
We wanna share your heart!

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:42.000
(How do you tell me?)
Amai kotoba o input

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:45.200
Shippai - Cancel - Zenzen hibikanai kedo
(Please don't be shy)

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:48.410
(How to make dream)
Touch shite todokete yo

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:52.830
Seikou - Complete - Saisentan ga ii darou?
(Hold me tight)

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:57.540
Naze koi to itte kurenai no?

00:22:57.540 --> 00:23:00.580
Ai ni yukou

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:07.750
Motto keiken shite level up otome gokoro

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:12.410
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:15.790
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:21.750
Oshiete ageru wa, koi wa otome no power!
(Love gave the power to Valkyrie)

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:25.290
Jucchuuhakku kitto mou lovers!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:28.660
Tokimeku mune dance, dance!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:31.870
Akuma de shy na mind, kiss for you!

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:35.080
Kaete shimau yo na, kiss for me!

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:38.450
Koi o hajimemasho!
